Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 17:19:42 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1159/1198] HERESY 1167: the player's waveform on its own
 ground with its bars back at 15 %, the player 15 % see-through, the
 passport's score on white, workspace names 80 characters at most
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 05.10.2026:
· «В обеих версиях плеера убери бекграунд из-под soundwave, пусть общий бекграунд плеера будет»: the waveform stands on the
  player's ground in either layout (no sunk box; its frame kept transparent so nothing moves);
· «ты убрал рисочки, как я просил. Попробуй 15% непрозрачности в них добавить»: the bars the cloud replaced (1118: one every
  3 px, the played ones in the accent) drawn again over it at 15 % (HeresyWave.set({bars: …}) tunes it, 0 takes them away);
· «Самому плееру… дай ему 15% прозрачности»: 15 % see-through (it was 20, 1105): the gradient that paints it (both stops)
  and the base rule, the blur under it kept;
· «В паспорте трека сделай бекграунд отрендеренной партитуры белым как и в Творце»: the datasheet's staff on the Creator's
  white sheet, abcjs inking it with the Creator's ink (read from the staff's own box, not the page's parchment);
· «В именах воркспейсов… не более 80 знаков»: the page's name boxes stop at 80, a section's at 80 less its parents (the lab
  refuses past it: the lab's own commit).
cdp-console 334/0/7, check-i18n 14/0, check-player 3/0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
